  "title": "Garmin announces finalists for the 2026 Garmin Health Awards",
  "summary": "OLATHE, Kan./June 23, 2026 – Garmin (NYSE: GRMN) today announced the finalists for the 2026 Garmin Health Awards. Each year, a select group of forward-thinking organizations present digital health and wellness applications incorporating the Garmin product portfolio to industry peers, leaders and journalists at the Garmin Health Summit, and two are recognized for the most innovative solutions. […]",
